# Analytics (optional).
#
# The tracking script is only emitted when BOTH variables are set AND the build
# is a production build — `pnpm dev` never sends data, and leaving these empty
# disables analytics entirely (the site then makes zero third-party requests).
#
# Set up with Umami Cloud (cookieless, no consent banner needed, tiny script):
#   1. Sign up at https://cloud.umami.is and add jscalon.dev as a website
#   2. Copy the "Website ID" it gives you
#   3. Add both variables in Netlify:
#      Site configuration -> Environment variables
#   4. Trigger a redeploy — env vars only apply to new builds
#
# To try it locally, copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and run `pnpm build`.

PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SRC=https://cloud.umami.is/script.js
PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
